# Minimal published tree.
#
# Only the application sources, the build script and the three documents below
# are tracked. Reference checkouts, test documents, local artifacts, build
# output and OS files stay local and are never published.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/build_app.sh
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/feature-list.md
!/src/
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/AppIcon-1024.png
!/assets/AppIcon.icns
